Tests ability to implement preventive controls in AWS using Config and Lambda remediation, including cross‑account access, encryption, and logging.

## Key Concepts
- AWS Config rules (managed/custom)
- Automated remediation with Lambda
- SSE-KMS encryption and CMK management
- Bucket policy TLS enforcement
- S3 BlockPublicAccess and server access logging
- Cross-account remediation roles and least privilege

